ned}-\\,{u}_{1}^{′}{e}^{-x}-2{u}_{2}^{′}{e}^{-2x}={x}^{2} \\\\ {u}_{1}^{′}{e}^{-x}+{u}_{2}^{′}{e}^{-2x}=0\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe wish to find an integral expression for ${u}_{2}.$ We start by eliminating ${u}_{1}^{′}$ from the second equation:\n\n$$\n{u}_{1}^{′}=-\\frac{{u}_{2}^{′}{e}^{-2x}}{{e}^{-x}}=-{u}_{2}^{′}{e}^{-x}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into the first equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-\\,{u}_{1}^{′}{e}^{-x}-2{u}_{2}^{′}{e}^{-2x} & ={x}^{2} \\\\ -\\,(-{u}_{2}^{′}{e}^{-x}){e}^{-x}-2{u}_{2}^{′}{e}^{-2x} & ={x}^{2} \\\\ {u}_{2}^{′}{e}^{-2x}-2{u}_{2}^{′}{e}^{-2x} & ={x}^{2} \\\\ -\\,{u}_{2}^{′}{e}^{-2x} & ={x}^{2} \\\\ {u}_{2}^{′} & =-{x}^{2}{e}^{2x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrating both sides with respect to $x,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int {u}_{2}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int -{x}^{2}{e}^{2x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ {u}_{2} & =-\\int {x}^{2}{e}^{2x}\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we conclude that $g(x)={x}^{2}{e}^{2x}.$" 13194139535934 true] [17592186375225 1000 #edb/ref 17592186375226 13194139535934 true] [17592186375225 1000 #edb/ref 17592186375227 13194139535934 true] [17592186375225 1000 #edb/ref 17592186375228 13194139535934 true] [17592186375225 1000 #edb/ref 17592186375229 13194139535934 true] [17592186375225 1000 #edb/ref 17592186375230 13194139535934 true] [17592186375225 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535934 true] [17592186375225 1041 "selection" 13194139535934 true] [17592186375225 1104 #edb/ref 17592186375227 13194139535934 true] [17592186375225 1110 #uuid "5a92ca98-a8bd-56e6-b20e-f3ac00c4282d" 13194139535934 true] [17592186375226 1034 "2{x}^{2}{e}^{2x}" 13194139535934 true] [17592186375226 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535934 true] [17592186375226 1111 #uuid "1950ab90-1d6f-5147-a9e7-4b43c9855536" 13194139535934 true] [17592186375227 1034 "{x}^{2}{e}^{2x}" 13194139535934 true] [17592186375227 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535934 true] [17592186375227 1111 #uuid "9f1b6b65-625d-5be2-a00c-8c977